  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Xenocreed Congregation",
    "summary": "While any **CHARACTER** models lead one of your **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** units, you can re-roll that unit's [Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step). If such a **CHARACTER** model is an **ACOLYTE ICONWARD**, **MAGUS** or **PRIMUS**, it gets **[Feel No Pain 3+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** while it leads that unit.",
